From 9fc0f4316bc398ca0be035a4d0d71b71f6138701 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@localhost>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:55:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] media: i2c: add fuxi IMX800 power and identity foundation

Implement the fuxi module's ordered power sequence and masked identity
check without sensor register writes or CAMSS access. Track each acquired
resource so failed startup can unwind and failed shutdown can retain its
reference for cleanup retry without a second enable.

Add an identity-only DT variant with the other camera clients disabled.
Exercise the shared sequencer with per-step failures and repeated cycles
in KUnit. These tests do not establish device power or capture acceptance.

